@startuml despliegue-sigiv
title Diagrama de despliegue - SIGIV-SM en LAN del local

skinparam nodeFontStyle bold

node "PC Mostrador 1\n(Windows 11)" as PC1 {
  artifact "sigiv-ferreteria.jar" as jar1
  artifact "JRE 21" as jre1
}

node "PC Mostrador 2\n(Windows 11)" as PC2 {
  artifact "sigiv-ferreteria.jar" as jar2
  artifact "JRE 21" as jre2
}

node "Servidor / PC Oficina\n(Ubuntu 22.04 LTS)" as SRV {
  artifact "sigiv-ferreteria.jar" as jar3
  artifact "JRE 21" as jre3
  database "MySQL 8.x\nsigiv_ferreteria" as DB
  artifact "Backup diario\n(mysqldump cron)" as backup
}

node "Router / Switch LAN\n192.168.1.0/24" as RTR

PC1 -down-> RTR : Ethernet
PC2 -down-> RTR : Ethernet
SRV -down-> RTR : Ethernet

jar1 ..> DB : JDBC / TCP 3306\n(usuario sigiv_app)
jar2 ..> DB : JDBC / TCP 3306\n(usuario sigiv_app)
jar3 ..> DB : JDBC localhost

note right of SRV
  Servidor centralizado:
  - MySQL escucha en :3306
  - Usuario aplicacion sigiv_app
    con permisos CRUD (sin DDL)
  - Backups automaticos diarios
  - Pisos de retencion: 30 dias
end note

note left of RTR
  Red LAN privada:
  - DHCP del router
  - SSID WPA2 para wifi del local
  - Cliente externo NO accede a 3306
end note

@enduml
